#. あ、苗木！
#. 大変だよ、大変ッ！！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Makoto! Big news! BIG NEWS!"
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>霧切ちゃん<CLT>が見つかったって！！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "We found <CLT 3>Kyoko<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. え！？　霧切さんがッ！？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. ぶ、無事なの？　どこにいるの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Is she okay? Where is she!?"
msgstr ""

#. …って言うか、大変なのはそれだけじゃなくって…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, I wasn't done. There's more big news!"
msgstr ""

#. ジャスティスロボまで参上しちゃったんだって！！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Robo Justice showed up, too!"
msgstr ""

#. …ジャスティスロボ！？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Robo Justice!?"
msgstr ""

#. …の衣装を着た<CLT 3>葉隠<CLT>がね！！
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's <CLT 3>Hiro<CLT> wearing the costume!"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく２階のプールまで来て！
#. 大至急だよ、お願いねッ！！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Anyway! As soon as you can, head to the pool, on the\n"
"2nd floor!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まさか、このタイミングで、
#. 葉隠クンと霧切さんがいっぺんに見つかるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To think Hiro and Kyoko would turn up at the same\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく急ごう！
#. ２階のプールだったよな！
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Anyway, I have to head to the pool!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは２階のプールへと走った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I ran off to the 2nd floor as fast as I could.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
